1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
That tail sticking out of this fish

2
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:02,560
belongs to the eel

3
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,820
it just swallowed.

4
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,760
Scientists filmed it on X-ray.

5
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,150
Inside the fish’s stomach,

6
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,790
the eel starts backing up.

7
00:00:08,830 --> 00:00:10,850
Its tail slides up the fish’s throat,

8
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:12,310
slips through a gap in the gills,

9
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:13,840
and pokes out the side.

10
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,960
Then the rest of its body follows.

11
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,960
Its head comes out last.

12
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,940
The eel curls up outside the fish,

13
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,260
gives one final pull,

14
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,000
and swims away

15
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:24,070
from the animal that just ate it.

